android-usage-stats: read Usage Access natively (org-activity)

Adds the android-usage-stats primitive (BEGIN-MS END-MS) to GNU Emacs
31.1's Android port, per the NATIVE-USAGE.org design in
khaalidrafi/org-activity: EmacsService.queryUsageStats (Java) + a
DEFUN in androidfns.c (C), following the established queryBattery /
getDocumentTrees service pattern.  Consumed by org-activity's
org-activity-android.el (already landed, guarded by fboundp).

Applies with: patch -p1 < patches/emacs/0001-android-usage-stats.patch

